  "description": "Roslyn analyzers for PostQuantum.Jwt: PQJWT001 forbids inspecting JOSE header fields (alg/jwk/jku/x5u/x5c) — the verification key comes from a trusted key ring, never the token — and PQJWT002 flags per-call PqJwtValidator construction. Add with PrivateAssets=\"all\". Production-quality companion package for controlled issuer/verifier systems; NOT independently audited (a permanent, documented limitation — see KNOWN-GAPS.md) and not a drop-in OAuth/OIDC replacement.",
